From: MilkFlint4 <builder@milkflint4>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: mt7988a: add cpufreq calibration efuse cell

Extracted from the 6.x complete-dtsi series so 842 (CPU voltage
calibration) can resolve &cpufreq_calibration on Linux 7.3.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt7988a.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt7988a.dtsi
@@ -717,6 +717,10 @@
 			soc-uuid@140 {
 				reg = <0x140 0x10>;
 			};
+
+			cpufreq_calibration: calib@278 {
+				reg = <0x278 0x1>;
+			};
 
 			lvts_calibration: calib@918 {
 				reg = <0x918 0x28>;
